TWEAK_NAME="Keep the cluster compass"
TWEAK_RISK="high"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Installs a small runtime into /data/opencmu/boot.d that mirrors the navigation bus name on /tmp/dbus_service_socket and sends com.jci.vbs.bcm.NoSpeedRestrict_TouchDisplay byte:1 while it runs, byte:0 when it stops. That is the mechanism the reference implementation uses for the tweak it calls cluster compass. Requires 60-startup-hook; the installer starts nothing itself."
